<h3 id="get-a-photos-statistics">Get a photo’s statistics</h3>

<p>Retrieve total number of downloads, views and likes of a single photo, as well as the historical breakdown of these stats in a specific timeframe (default is 30 days).</p>

<pre><code>GET /photos/:id/statistics
</code></pre>

<h4 id="parameters-9">Parameters</h4>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>param</th>
      <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><code>id</code></td>
      <td>The public id of the photo. Required.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>resolution</code></td>
      <td>The frequency of the stats. (Optional; default: “days”)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>quantity</code></td>
      <td>The amount of for each stat. (Optional; default: 30)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p>Currently, the only resolution param supported is “days”. The quantity param can be any number between 1 and 30.</p>

<h4 id="response-9">Response</h4>

<pre><code>200 OK
X-Ratelimit-Limit: 1000
X-Ratelimit-Remaining: 999
</code></pre>

