    <span class="dl">"</span><span class="s2">html</span><span class="dl">"</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="dl">"</span><span class="s2">https://unsplash.com/collections/206/makers-cat-and-ben</span><span class="dl">"</span><span class="p">,</span>
    <span class="dl">"</span><span class="s2">photos</span><span class="dl">"</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="dl">"</span><span class="s2">https://api.unsplash.com/collections/206/photos</span><span class="dl">"</span>
  <span class="p">}</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

</code></pre></div></div>

<h3 id="delete-a-collection">Delete a collection</h3>

<p>Delete a collection belonging to the logged-in user. This requires the <code>write_collections</code> scope.</p>

<pre><code>DELETE /collections/:id
</code></pre>

<h4 id="parameters-21">Parameters</h4>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>param</th>
      <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><code>id</code></td>
      <td>The collection’s ID. Required.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h4 id="response-21">Response</h4>

<p>Responds with a 204 status and an empty body.</p>

<pre><code>204 No Content
X-Ratelimit-Limit: 1000
X-Ratelimit-Remaining: 999
</code></pre>

<h3 id="add-a-photo-to-a-collection">Add a photo to a collection</h3>

<p>Add a photo to one of the logged-in user’s collections. Requires the <code>write_collections</code> scope.</p>

<pre><code>POST /collections/:collection_id/add
</code></pre>

<p><em>Note</em>: If the photo is already in the collection, this acion has no effect.</p>

<h4 id="parameters-22">Parameters</h4>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>param</th>
      <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><code>collection_id</code></td>
      <td>The collection’s ID. Required.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>photo_id</code></td>
      <td>The photo’s ID. Required.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h4 id="response-22">Response</h4>

<pre><code>201 Created
X-Ratelimit-Limit: 1000
X-Ratelimit-Remaining: 999
</code></pre>

