<h3 id="get-a-topic">Get a topic</h3>

<p>Retrieve a single topic.</p>

<pre><code>GET /topics/:id_or_slug
</code></pre>

<p><em>Note</em>: See the note on <a href="#hotlinking">hotlinking</a>.</p>

<h4 id="parameters-25">Parameters</h4>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>param</th>
      <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><code>id_or_slug</code></td>
      <td>The topics’s ID or slug. Required.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h4 id="response-25">Response</h4>

<pre><code>200 OK
X-Ratelimit-Limit: 1000
X-Ratelimit-Remaining: 999
</code></pre>

<div class="language-javascript highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="p">{</span>
